              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Epote ituŋa anyoun kokide, koto, ka agolitomei ka eŋalakimak da, iboikinos kesi toma ajakanut naka Edeke, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
